[h1]Speculative Markets - CMF Compatibility[/h1]
Keeps the Finance button working alongside CMF's sidebar buttons. No gameplay changes.

[h2]Load order[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3385002128]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831434383]Speculative Markets[/url] or [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839275304]Beta[/url] - use one
[*]This patch
[/list]
Without CMF, you don't need this patch.

[h2]Morgenroete[/h2]
Also using Morgenroete? Add the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839705018]Morgenroete patch[/url]. Load CMF > Morgenroete > Speculative Markets > Morgenroete patch > this patch.

Disable the old Speculative Markets+Morgenroete patch.

Compatible with Speculative Markets 1.0.6, Beta 1.0.6-beta.1, CMF 1.67.6 and Victoria 3 1.15.1. Patch version: 1.0.1.

[h2]Credits[/h2]
CMF is made by the Victoria 3 Modding Co-op.
